***HELPSTRINGS
ID_TGIRR_HBD     [Ve duong bao Boundary Polyline xung quanh cac doi tuong Hatch co]
ID_TGIRR_JH      [Gop cac Hatch phan manh giap nhau thanh 1 va tao duong bao chung]
ID_TGIRR_SP2PL   [Chuyen nhanh cac doi tuong SPLINE/REGION sang LWPOLYLINE khap kin]
ID_TGIRR_CVPL    [Chuyen LINE/ARC/CIRCLE/ELLIPSE/SPLINE/POLYLINE/REGION sang LWPOLYLINE (CVPLG giu nguon)]
ID_TGIRR_SBS     [Chon cac doi tuong giong mau nam phan lon trong Polyline kin]
ID_TGIRR_SBSE    [Chon chinh xac doi tuong theo mau trong bien kin (trung ca noi dung TEXT/MTEXT)]
ID_TGIRR_VDNG    [Ve day nho giot ben trong Boundary kin]
ID_TGIRR_TNET    [Mo hop thoai tao/chinh sua net ve co chu (file LIN)]
ID_TGIRR_TGL     [Tao bo layer tieu chuan va dat TG-DRIP lam layer hien hanh]
ID_TGIRR_TL      [Cong tong chieu dai cac duong da chon truoc]
ID_TGIRR_TGN     [Danh so doi tuong / vung tuoi bang nhan tron/ellipse]
ID_TGIRR_CPLUS   [Copy TEXT/MTEXT/Multileader/Attribute/Dimension theo quy luat]
ID_TGIRR_DOITEXT [Chuyen MText sang Text tai cho hoac gom nhieu MText thanh 1 danh sach cot thang hang]
ID_TGIRR_DOIMTEXT [Gop cac dong TEXT thanh 1 MTEXT nhieu doan (Enter xuong dong trong MTEXT)]
ID_TGIRR_PALETTE [Bat hoac tat bang cong cu TGIRR CAD Palette]
ID_TGIRR_QUICK   [Bat hoac tat palette Quick Tools rieng (cac nut da ghim vao Quick Tools)]
ID_TGIRR_BAR     [Bat thanh cong cu icon native (toolbar TGIRR CAD) tu file TGIRR_CAD.mnu]
